<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Reservation Confirmation</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f7f7f7;
        color: #333;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        background-color: #fff;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 30px;
      }
      h2 {
        color: #1e90ff;
      }
      .section {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .section h3 {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        color: #444;
      }
      .details {
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #888;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <p>Hello <%= guestName %>,</p>

      <p>
        Thank you for choosing <%= hotelName %>! We're excited to welcome you.
        Your reservation has been confirmed. Here are the details:
      </p>

      <div class="section">
        <h3>Reservation Details</h3>
        <div class="details">
          <p><strong>Reservation Number:</strong> <%= reservationId %></p>
          <p><strong>Check-in:</strong> <%= checkInDate %></p>
          <p><strong>Check-out:</strong> <%= checkOutDate %></p>
          <p><strong>Total Price:</strong> Rs <%= totalPrice %></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="details">
          <p><strong>Address:</strong> <%= hotelAddress %></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        If you have any questions or special requests, feel free to reply to
        this email. We look forward to making your stay comfortable and
        enjoyable.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
